<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/demos/demo-20/ChapterChase.png">
    <title>ChapterChase </title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #3498db;
            --secondary-color: #2c3e50;
            --accent-color: #e74c3c;
            --background-color: #ecf0f1;
            --text-color: #333;
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: var(--background-color);
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        header {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        main {
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .about-section {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        h2 {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .mission {
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .feature {
            flex-basis: calc(33.333% - 1rem);
            background-color: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .cta {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #c0392b;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .feature {
                flex-basis: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>About ChapterChase</h1>
            <p>Your Literary Journey Begins Here</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="about-section">
            <h2>Our Story</h2>
            <p>ChapterChase was born out of a passion for books and a desire to create a haven for book lovers. Founded in 2020, we've quickly grown to become a leading online bookstore, connecting readers with their next great adventure.</p>
            <p>Our team of dedicated bookworms works tirelessly to curate a diverse collection of titles, from timeless classics to cutting-edge contemporary works, ensuring there's something for every reader.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mission">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>At ChapterChase, we believe in the power of stories to inspire, educate, and transform. Our mission is to make the joy of reading accessible to all, fostering a community of lifelong learners and passionate readers.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Vast Selection</h3>
                <p>Explore our extensive catalogue of over 1 million titles across all genres.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Expert Recommendations</h3>
                <p>Discover your next favorite book with personalized suggestions from our team of literary experts.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>Community</h3>
                <p>Join our vibrant community of readers for discussions, reviews, and book clubs.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
            <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
            <p>We're committed to promoting literacy, supporting emerging authors, and making a positive impact in the literary world. Through our partnerships with schools and non-profit organizations, we're working to put books in the hands of those who need them most.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="cta">
            <a href="/home" class="button">Return to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>